? Pay nightly instead. | Built for campers in Canada & the US Instant results Free to use How much do you spend camping? | What do you cam", "ightly rate you enter and published membership pricing. Actual value depends on campground selection, booking availability, and how fully you use your nights. | Browse 80+ Campgrounds → Good to know How the Math Works | $65 Average nightly rate Our planning assumption (edit it above) 16 Nights to break even On the Getaway Pass at $65/night average 30 Nights included In every Getaway Pass — that's $1,950 in nightly va", "nds → Good to know How the Math Works | $65 Average nightly rate Our planning assumption (edit it above) 16 Nights to break even On the Getaway Pass at $65/night average 30 Nights included In every Getaway Pass — that's $1,950 in nightly value Real members on the math In their own words | Lifestyle member · Founding “It didn’t take us long to realize the membership was exactly what we needed to make travel in retirem", " 2026 to start Pre-season member feedback collected April 2026, with text consent. Quotes verbatim. | Put It in Perspective What Else Does That Money Buy? | Accommodation Avg. Nightly 1 Week 30 Nights 6 Months | Hotel | $175/night | $1,225 | $5,250 | $31,500 | | Airbnb | $200/night | $1,400 | $6,000 | $36,000 | | Getaway Pass 30 Nights | $0/night | — | $999 | — | | Lifestyle Membership Up to 6 Months | $0/night | — |", "ive What Else Does That Money Buy? | Accommodation Avg. Nightly 1 Week 30 Nights 6 Months | Hotel | $175/night | $1,225 | $5,250 | $31,500 | | Airbnb | $200/night | $1,400 | $6,000 | $36,000 | | Getaway Pass 30 Nights | $0/night | — | $999 | — | | Lifestyle Membership Up to 6 Months | $0/night | — | — | Covered. One membership, no end date | | Hotel and Airbnb rates are illustrative assumptions, not measured averages", "p, no end date | | Hotel and Airbnb rates are illustrative assumptions, not measured averages. | More questions Cost Calculator FAQ | How much does camping cost p